  "title": "U.S. Urged Venezuela and Iraq to Consider Leaving OPEC, Reuters Reports",
  "deck": "Washington wanted both countries to pump more oil. Iraq's oil ministry backed staying in the group, and Saudi Arabia reportedly persuaded the U.S. to ease pressure on Venezuela.",
  "category": "economy",
  "categoryLabel": "Economy & Energy",
